module yaaihh.first

import std.hooks as H
import std.comms as C
import std.budgets as B
import std.control as Ctrl
import std.bridges.claude_code
import std.bridges.codex
import std.bridges.opencode
import std.bridges.agy
import yaaihh.desk as Desk

// The smallest yaaihh project: the desk and nothing around it. His words reach an agent and the agent's answer
// reaches him. It loads no clerk, no looker, no brain, no train and no guards, so it asks no model and waits on no
// clock: the top for a first project on this engine, before the drivers the whole package needs exist.
// What it asks of drivers: his window's lines and an agent's (`Owner-Seated`, `Owner-Says`, `Owner-Posts`, `Written`,
// `Spoke`, `Shown`), a passage's words (`TextOf`) and the delivery (`Deliver`). It also names `Command` and the
// three Effects of a copy on busy, which it never performs.
// Its texts: std/hooks, the four bridges, std/comms, std/budgets, std/control, defaults/desk, and this file.

+H.Party("yaaihh.first").
Extend Fact C.May-Speak
  Holds when C.Role(who, "front")
